{
    "title": "theCut: Find Barbers Anywhere",
    "description": "GET THE HAIRCUT YOU WANT WHEREVER YOU ARE\r\nDiscover over 15,000 barbers around the US on our network. theCut is the best way to find talented barbers and easily schedule your next haircut. Easily book a barber for whatever the occasion \u2014 same-day cuts, house calls, weddings, while traveling for business or pleasure.\r\n\r\nTOTAL PRICE TRANSPARENCY\r\nWith theCut, barbers showcase their skills and services upfront. This means you can see what's included in services and how much it will cost. You know what you're paying for before sitting in the chair.\r\n\r\nTIP AND RATE BARBERS\r\nWith theCut, you can set the amount you want to tip after your barber has finished the haircut, all with our in-app, secure payment system. You can also rate and review your barber. This helps elevate your barber and creates that authentic community feedback that makes theCut the premier destination for clients to discover barbers.\r\n\r\nBARBERS GET DISCOVERED BY CLIENTS NATIONWIDE\r\nEvery month, 50,000 clients find a barber on theCut. You can ditch the business cards and grow your business with high visibility on theCut and our simple and clean booking experience.\r\n\r\nTHE NEW WAY TO ELEVATE YOUR BARBER BUSINESS\r\nYou can manage your schedule, clients, and finances all with theCut. Features like auto-confirming appointments, business analytics, client notifications, and payment processing help streamline a barber's day-to-day activities.\r\n\r\nCREATE LOYALTY AND REWARDS PROGRAMS\r\nYou can set up loyalty and reward campaigns for clients. This allows them to earn discounts and promotions for regularly booking haircuts and referring new customers to you.",
    "descriptionHTML": "GET THE HAIRCUT YOU WANT WHEREVER YOU ARE<br>Discover over 15,000 barbers around the US on our network. theCut is the best way to find talented barbers and easily schedule your next haircut. Easily book a barber for whatever the occasion \u2014 same-day cuts, house calls, weddings, while traveling for business or pleasure.<br><br>TOTAL PRICE TRANSPARENCY<br>With theCut, barbers showcase their skills and services upfront. This means you can see what&#39;s included in services and how much it will cost. You know what you&#39;re paying for before sitting in the chair.<br><br>TIP AND RATE BARBERS<br>With theCut, you can set the amount you want to tip after your barber has finished the haircut, all with our in-app, secure payment system. You can also rate and review your barber. This helps elevate your barber and creates that authentic community feedback that makes theCut the premier destination for clients to discover barbers.<br><br>BARBERS GET DISCOVERED BY CLIENTS NATIONWIDE<br>Every month, 50,000 clients find a barber on theCut. You can ditch the business cards and grow your business with high visibility on theCut and our simple and clean booking experience.<br><br>THE NEW WAY TO ELEVATE YOUR BARBER BUSINESS<br>You can manage your schedule, clients, and finances all with theCut. Features like auto-confirming appointments, business analytics, client notifications, and payment processing help streamline a barber&#39;s day-to-day activities.<br><br>CREATE LOYALTY AND REWARDS PROGRAMS<br>You can set up loyalty and reward campaigns for clients. This allows them to earn discounts and promotions for regularly booking haircuts and referring new customers to you.",
